NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000823 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000824 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000825 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000826 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Getopt-Long-Util>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000827 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000828 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000829 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000830 "feature."
